eived_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":341,"closed_issues":2335,"state":"open","created_at":"2026-04-13T15:59:35Z","updated_at":"2026-10-22T03:07:42Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":17,"created_at":"2026-04-25T02:09:12Z","updated_at":"2026-08-06T00:36:31Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in: 4.7-dev5, 4.7-beta1\nNot reproducible in: 4.7-dev4 and earlier\n\n### System information\n\nSteamOS - Godot v4.7.0.dev5 - Vulkan (Forward+)\n\n### Issue description\n\nStarting with the introduction of wayland touch support in 4.7-dev5, touch controls show by default with prefer wayland enabled in editor settings, even on non touch-based displays, as long as there is a touch compatible display connected.\n\n<img width=\"2560\" height=\"1440\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/84b3ba24-64f6-45e6-acf0-761dc4c08349\" />\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n1. Run a system that currently has a touch based display connected, in my case that would be a steam deck conneted to an external monitor with a dock.\n2. Run godot on the non-touch display.\n3. Go into editor settings -> run -> platform, enable prefer wayland, then save and restart.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[touch_test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/27071485/touch_test.zip)","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118938/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118938/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}